{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Programmer vs Software Developer"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear or use to talk about Programmers and  Software Developers."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe common activities at work using short sentences in familiar spoken and written situations.  Make the result report from the analysis of the information system, based on the customer requirements, following established rules and protocols."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Participates in simple conversations or simulated situations about the communicative topics for this level through the appropriate use of simple pronunciation aspects, and grammar and vocabulary structures.  Recognizes simple ideas on requirement reports, tools for Object Oriented Programming, and other basic programming tools."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "advertise  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to call public's attention  about a product, service or need through a paid announcement, published in newspapers, magazines, over radio or television"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What positions are you advertising?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hire"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to obtain the services of a person for wages or other payment"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb): "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your competitors only hired one person for the same post."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "currently"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "at the moment , now "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our Company is currently hiring software developers and programmers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "upgrade"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to improve the quality or value of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This person should be an expert upgrading software and recommending customers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob10aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "prospect"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a potential or likely candidate"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun): "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our prospect programmers will be mostly in charge of the implementation of software."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob10aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "duties"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "functions, tasks or activities that one is expected or  required to do by moral or legal obligation. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun):"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What duties would you like to include for the post? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob10aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Compound Nouns and Collective Nouns"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<div align=\"justify\">A noun is a word that identifies a person, animal, place, thing, or idea. You can find <span class=\"strong\">compound </span> and <span class=\"strong\">collective Nouns.</span><br />   "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div align=\"justify\"><span class=\"strong\">Collective nouns </span>are names for a group of individuals or a number of animals, places, things, objects, concepts or ideas. These nouns take a singular verb when we think of them as a group.<br /><br />    * Let's see below some examples:<br /><br />     <li>A herd of elephants.</li>  <li>A range of mountains.</li> <li>A gang of thieves.</li> <li>A pack of cards.</li> <li>A board of directors.</li><br />       A <span class=\"strong\">compound noun </span> is the result of combining two words. Below, you can see how they look:<br /><br />  <li><span class=\"strong\">Separate words</span>: orange juice, real estate, post office, car park.</li> <li><span class=\"strong\">Words linked by a hyphen</span> mother-in-law, washing-up, check-in.</li> <li><span class=\"strong\">One word</span> notebook, classroom, football, bedroom, toothpaste.</li></div><br /> "}, {"type": "example", "content": "We would like to post a job offer  with your newspaper.\t"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It also guarantees the effective teamwork in our department."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Action Verbs and Participle Adjectives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<div align=\"justify\"><span class=\"strong\">Action Verbs</span> are verbs that express actions that people, animals, objects, or process nature can do.<br/>  <span class=\"strong\">Participle adjectives</span> are participles which can be used as adjectives by adding the <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">\u2013ed</span></span> to talk about a person's feeling or <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">\u2013ing</span></span> to talk about the specific cause of feeling to the base form of the verb.</div>  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "They write automated tests, keep systems updated, write documentation, and they need to read codes. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Update and expand existing programs and use code libraries to simplify the writing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Below there are two charts of action verbs and participles adjectives related to programmers and software developers."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Action Verbs \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Calculate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Command \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Edit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simulate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Control\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Launch\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Run \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Test and update\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Debug\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Participle Adjectives\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Alarm\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Alarmed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Alarming\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Amuse\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Amused\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Amusing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Confuse\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Confused\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Confusing \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for information about different roles in IT."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe different functions in its roles."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph describing differences between roles."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show your paragraph to your classmates and teacher."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I look for information about roles"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe different functions in roles."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a paragraph."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I show my paragraph."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n3le02ob10re5vqz01pt1", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "Watch this video carefully. Take notes when necessary."}]}, "type": "video"}], "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "id": 3, "title": ""}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n3le02ob10re5vqz01pt2", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "Watch this video carefully. Take notes when necessary."}]}, "type": "video"}], "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "id": 4, "title": ""}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n3le02ob10re5vqz01pt3", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "Watch this video carefully. Take notes when necessary."}]}, "type": "video"}], "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "id": 5, "title": ""}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n3le02ob10re2vid01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist: </span>\nNew times, how can I help you? </br>"}, {"time": "4000", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Manager: </span>\nI'm calling from HIGHTECH. We would like to post a job offer with your newspaper. </br>"}, {"time": "10800", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist: </span>\nWhat positions are you advertising? </br>"}, {"time": "13500", "image": "", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Manager: </span>\nOur company is currently hiring software developers and programmers. </br>"}, {"time": "18500", "image": "", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist: </span>\nAre these two positions different? Your competitors only hired one person for the same post. </br>"}, {"time": "25000", "image": "", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Manager: </span>\nAs a multinational we define these two jobs differently; they respond to two different steps in our processes. It also guarantees the effective teamwork in our department. We want our programmers to write, test, debug, and update the detailed instructions for computer programs so they can run and perform their functions. Our programmers should design and test logical structures for solving problems.  On the other hand, we want our software developers to be the creative minds behind computer programs.  They need to write automated tests, keep systems updated, and write documentation.  They also need to read codes. </br>"}, {"time": "84000", "image": "", "id": 6, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist: </span>\nWhat duties would you like to include for the post? </br>"}, {"time": "87000", "image": "", "id": 7, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Manager: </span>\nOur software developers are people with high skills in researching, designing, programming, and testing. This person should be an expert at finding solutions to problems, upgrading software, and recommending customers.  It is also important that they can ensure functioning of programs and document key aspects of the system as a reference for maintenance and upgrades.  On the contrary, prospect programmers will be mostly in charge of the implementation of software; someone with good algorithmic knowledge who can write codes for many kinds of software.  Back to software developers, they have to make software clean, well-factored, and error free.  In addition, they write programs in a variety of computer languages, such as C++ and Java.  Finally, it is very important that they can update and expand existing programs, using code libraries to simplify the writing. </br>"}, {"time": "163000", "image": "", "id": 8, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist: </span>\nOk, we have all the necessary information to publish the ad. <br/>"}]}, "type": "video"}], "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "id": 6, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about the differences among jobs and occupations related to IT. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can explain duties related to different job occupations in IT. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can explain why some occupations are different."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What jobs in IT the department do you know and which are the best paid?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "In your opinion, what skills should a programmer and a software developer have? "}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "IT Occupations"}],